---
title: View, edit, delete bookings — own vs any (requirements 4–9)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as User or Admin
    participant P as protect + authorize
    participant C as controllers/bookings
    participant B as Booking model

    A->>P: GET / PUT / DELETE /bookings/:id
    alt not logged in
        P-->>A: 401 Not authorized
    end
    P->>C: getBooking / updateBooking / deleteBooking
    C->>C: scope(req)
    Note over C: user: {_id, user: me, deletedAt: null}<br/>admin: {_id, deletedAt: null}
    C->>B: findOne(scope)
    alt someone else's booking (user) or not found
        C-->>A: 404 No booking with this id
    end
    opt PUT: new dates
        C->>C: parseStay() + room check, as when booking
    end
    opt DELETE
        C->>B: set deletedAt (soft delete)
    end
    C-->>A: 200 {booking}
